## Article 10. Prohibition of disclosure of information contained in appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article10Confidentiality:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input personalInfoDisclosed content YesNo
  input authorConsent content YesNo
  output stateSecretDisclosed content YesNo
  output otherProtectedSecretDisclosed content YesNo
  output rightsInfringedByDisclosure content YesNo
  output dataIrrelevantToAppealCollected content YesNo
  output authorRequestedConfidentiality content YesNo
  output appealConfidential content YesNo
  output disclosureToCaseParticipantsAllowed content YesNo
  output disclosureProhibited content YesNo

scope Article10Confidentiality:
  label state_secret_disclosed_exception default_no_state_secret
  definition stateSecretDisclosed under condition
    personalInfoDisclosed = Yes and authorConsent = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_state_secret
  definition stateSecretDisclosed equals No

  label other_secret_disclosed_exception default_no_other_secret
  definition otherProtectedSecretDisclosed under condition
    personalInfoDisclosed = Yes and authorConsent = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_other_secret
  definition otherProtectedSecretDisclosed equals No

  label rights_infringed_exception default_no_infringement
  definition rightsInfringedByDisclosure under condition
    personalInfoDisclosed = Yes and authorConsent = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_infringement
  definition rightsInfringedByDisclosure equals No

  label irrelevant_data_exception default_no_irrelevant
  definition dataIrrelevantToAppealCollected under condition
    personalInfoDisclosed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_irrelevant
  definition dataIrrelevantToAppealCollected equals No

  label author_requested_exception default_no_request
  definition authorRequestedConfidentiality under condition
    author.lastName <> ""
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_request
  definition authorRequestedConfidentiality equals No

  label case_participants_exception default_not_participants
  definition disclosureToCaseParticipantsAllowed under condition
    authorRequestedConfidentiality = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_participants
  definition disclosureToCaseParticipantsAllowed equals No

  label disclosure_prohibited_exception default_disclosure_ok
  definition disclosureProhibited under condition
    authorRequestedConfidentiality = Yes
    or stateSecretDisclosed = Yes
    or otherProtectedSecretDisclosed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_disclosure_ok
  definition disclosureProhibited equals No
```
